    },
    {
      "type": "sentences",
      "items": [
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "I want to talk to you about what a government can do."
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "I want to cancel my order."
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "He promised me to come again."
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "I'm on a diet to lose weight."
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Give me a minute to change."
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "He pretended to be happy."
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "They planned to attend a rally."
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "The police threatened to use firearms."
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "They were determined to wipe out the student movement."
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "The government is trying to establish a climate of respect for law and order."
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "Tobacco industry executives sought to hide their knowledge that their product was addictive."
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "Where should I get off to go to the station?"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "I'll tell you when."
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "This is a wrong place for him to announce the news."
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "It's part of a bid to stop smoking among teenagers."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
